SUMMARY:Blue & Gold Banquet - Pack 149
DESCRIPTION:We would like to invite our Pack 149 families to join us for our annual awards ceremony!This is the moment when your scout will receive their rank advancement for the year.  Please join us to share a great meal with the entire pack\, have some fun\, and support your child as they take the next step in scouting!If you would like dinner\, please complete this form:  https://pci.jotform.com/form/250913507077154.  Please be aware that you can still attend if you don't purchase food.
