BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7078781@advancements.scouting.org
CREATED:20260810T014250Z
ORGANIZER:David Markel
DTSTART:20260901T233000Z
DTEND:20260902T010000Z
SUMMARY:Join Scouting Night/Physical Challange
DESCRIPTION:Join Scouting Night &amp; Physical Challenge!Pack 149 invites all new and returning scouts and their families to kick off another year of adventure! Come learn what Cub Scouting is all about and catch up on what our pack has planned for the upcoming year. While parents get the inside scoop\, scouts will head to the back of the school to jump into a series of fun physical challenges. Come meet the team\, reconnect with old friends\, and get ready for a great year!
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/7078781
LOCATION:Spicewood Elementary
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7079035@advancements.scouting.org
CREATED:20260810T024145Z
ORGANIZER:David Markel
DTSTART:20260816T130000Z
DTEND:20260816T143000Z
SUMMARY:Back to School Event - Capture the Flag/Kickball
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the start of the school year with Pack 149! Drop by Spicewood Elementary for a fun morning of outdoor games and snacks.Activities: Capture the Flag and/or Kickball on the fieldTreats: Refreshments providedWho: All returning scouts\, new families\, and prospective scouts welcome!
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/7079035
LOCATION:Spicewood Elementary
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7079048@advancements.scouting.org
CREATED:20260810T024912Z
ORGANIZER:David Markel
DTSTART:20260817T000000Z
DTEND:20260817T010000Z
SUMMARY:Pack 149 - Leader/Comittee Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our monthly planning meeting as we coordinate upcoming events\, review pack logistics\, and plan activities for our scouts. This meeting is for all Den Leaders\, Committee Members\, and any interested parents who want to get involved in planning activities and supporting Pack 149.
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/7079048
LOCATION:Hope Presbyterian Church
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7079063@advancements.scouting.org
CREATED:20260810T025608Z
ORGANIZER:David Markel
DTSTART:20261006T233000Z
DTEND:20261007T003000Z
SUMMARY:Pack Meeting - Bobcat Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate a major milestone in your scout's journey! The Bobcat Ceremony honors our newest scouts as they earn their very first rank badge. By completing the Bobcat Adventure\, these scouts have learned the Scout Oath\, Scout Law\, and the core spirit of Scouting. Join us for a memorable event as we recognize their hard work and welcome them into the Pack 149 family-a proud moment for scouts and parents alike!
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/7079063
LOCATION:Spicewood Elementary
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7079146@advancements.scouting.org
CREATED:20260810T031102Z
ORGANIZER:David Markel
DTSTART:20261120T060000Z
DTEND:20261123T054500Z
SUMMARY:Fall Campout - Camp Tahuaya
DESCRIPTION:Join Pack 149 from November 20 to 22 at Camp Tahuaya for our annual Fall Campout! The entire pack will head outdoors for a weekend family camping experience filled with tent camping\, trail exploration\, outdoor cooking\, and traditional campfire fun. All dens and family members are invited to set up camp\, participate in group activities\, and enjoy a night under the Texas stars together during one of our most anticipated events of the year. 
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/7079146
LOCATION:Camp Tahuaya 
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7079147@advancements.scouting.org
CREATED:20260810T031354Z
ORGANIZER:David Markel
DTSTART:20261209T003000Z
DTEND:20261209T020000Z
SUMMARY:Pack Meeting: Holiday Bazaar
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Holiday Market! Scouts get to make and sell their own homemade crafts\, treats\, or simple toys to fellow scouts in a fun\, flea-market-style setup. It is a great way for the kids to practice basic money skills\, show off their creativity\, and celebrate together before winter break.
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/7079147
LOCATION:Spicewood Elementary
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7081280@advancements.scouting.org
CREATED:20260810T194543Z
ORGANIZER:David Markel
DTSTART:20270113T003000Z
DTEND:20270113T013000Z
SUMMARY:Pack Meeting: AOL and Crossover Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:oin us as we celebrate our 5th-grade Arrow of Light scouts completing their final Cub Scout rank and transitioning into Scouts BSA! The whole pack will gather as our oldest scouts cross the bridge to join their new troops and start the next chapter of their Scouting journey. It is a big night for Pack 149\, and we encourage all dens and families to come out and cheer them on.
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/7081280
LOCATION:Spicewood Elementary
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7081289@advancements.scouting.org
CREATED:20260810T194837Z
ORGANIZER:David Markel
DTSTART:20270227T230000Z
DTEND:20270228T013000Z
SUMMARY:Pinewood Derby
DESCRIPTION:Get your wood blocks and sand paper ready! It is Pinewood Derby time for Pack 149. Scouts build and race their own custom wooden cars down our official track to compete for speed\, design\, and creativity awards. Bring the whole family to cheer on the racers\, grab a spot near the track\, and see what the kids built this year.
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/7081289
LOCATION:Spicewood Elementary
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7081308@advancements.scouting.org
CREATED:20260810T195710Z
ORGANIZER:David Markel
DTSTART:20270424T223000Z
DTEND:20270425T003000Z
SUMMARY:Pack Meeting: Blue and Gold Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:The pack's annual awards banquet celebrating another year of achievements. Rank advancements\, adventure badges\, and special recognitions are presented in a festive setting with the whole pack community gathered together.
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/7081308
LOCATION:Spicewood Elementary
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7081316@advancements.scouting.org
CREATED:20260810T200023Z
ORGANIZER:David Markel
DTSTART:20270511T233000Z
DTEND:20270512T003000Z
SUMMARY:Pack Meeting: Cubmaster Challenge
DESCRIPTION:A pack-wide skills competition to close out the program year. Scouts are tested on what they have learned: navigation\, knots\, outdoor skills\, teamwork\, and more. A fun send-off that celebrates the growth scouts have made over the course of the year.
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/7081316
LOCATION:Spicewood Elementary
END:VEVENT
